[[File:Arc Traps in action.png|thumb|right|Two poles casting a beam that causing the Arc Trap debuff]]
An '''arc trap''' is an environmental hazard that appears as a beam of electricity arcing between two poles. When a character touches the beam, they are [[shock]]ed and inflicted with the "Arc Trap" [[debuff]], which reduces their [[action speed]]. The beam also rapidly inflicts [[hit]]s of [[lightning damage]] to the character based on a percentage of their maximum life. These hits can be [[block]]ed if the character has a chance to block spell damage.

