* [[The Refinery]]
* Vault of Venarius sub-area of [[The Haunted Reliquary]]
* {{il|Factory Map}}
* [[Pesquin, the Mad Baron]] (standalone version - [[Maven]])
* [[The Eradicator]]'s arena
* [[Guardian of the Minotaur]]'s arena

